      {
        "id": 87771,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-05T05:19:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span><span>Legacy walked up to the slumped over Baron Blade, he started to push himself up, coughing, but almost laughing.</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span>Legacy grabbed the Baron’s head, prepared to snap his neck, but she paused. &nbsp;Stephen stepped forward,</span></span></p><p><span><span>“Let him go.”</span></span></p><p><span><span>Legacy released her captive and stepped back,</span></span></p><p><span><span>“What are you doing?” Anthony asked.</span></span></p><p><span><span>There was no answer. &nbsp;Graves simply stepped forward, levelled his flak cannon and fired.</span></span></p><p><span><span>. . . </span></span></p><p><span><span>Baron Blade was dead, or at least a Baron Blade that didn’t exist anymore died. &nbsp;It wasn’t easy to wrap your head around it. &nbsp;By dying in Paris Blade couldn’t ness with the timeline and things would be normal again. &nbsp;So the heroes would return from Mars to find the world they expected to find, and none of this would ever happen.</span></span></p><p><span><span>But they were still here. &nbsp;Flying back to England, it didn’t make much sense. &nbsp;Worse than that they couldn’t stay here, there were so many ways to pollute the timeline, to undo the good they did today.</span></span></p><p><span><span>But they also didn’t have anywhere to go.</span></span></p><p><span><span>Jim and his robot friends had plenty of options, but Pauline, Anthony and Stephen’s worlds no longer existed. &nbsp;That was why they came here, to undo those timelines. &nbsp;Now those timelines were gone but they remained.</span></span></p><p><span><span>There was a lot of disagreement over where to go. &nbsp;They ended up with two main options:</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span>There was disagreement over what to do next. &nbsp;Graves and Anthony both wanted to see what the world was like after undoing Blade’s tampering, and while she knew it wasn’t the best course, Pauline wanted to see her father, at least once more before she went off and hid in time. &nbsp;Con had agreed to take them where they wanted to go, but the decision remained:</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span>Time to Vote!</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span>1. &nbsp;Go back to the “present,” make sure things are normal risking interfering</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. &nbsp;Start breaking up the team and find a place they (and time) could be safe.</span></span></p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
        "post_number": 77,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:12:09.861Z",
